# Captured live-page artifacts from manual scraper runs. These are multi-MB
# saved Google Flights pages/screenshots kept only as local debugging samples;
# nothing in the repo imports them. They must not be tracked: the served page
# embeds Google's own client-side API key (AIza...) and large base64 data-URIs,
# which trip secret scanners (real finding: google_flights_test.html). Keep such
# samples local.
google_flights_test.html
google_flights_test.png
*.captured.html
